# NOTHING HERE IS IGNORED ANY MORE, except caches that are worthless by definition.
#
# This file used to start with a bare `*` and then try to claw source back with `!*.py`.
# That does not work, and it silently cost us 77 authored files: git will not re-include
# a file if one of its PARENT DIRECTORIES is excluded, so `!*.py` only ever applied at
# the top level of this directory and every hud.py, slice_ref.py and LAYOUT.md living in
# a subdirectory was invisible to git. Only 16 of this tree's files were tracked.
#
# Checkouts share this repo through GitHub, so anything not committed does not
# exist in the others. The original reference art is in here and is not reproducible
# from anything; the derived slices are, but they are small and telling them apart by
# eye is exactly the judgement call that loses work.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
